{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">[Summary]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They were taken away as food for Vampire. It is a prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They put me in a cell and I can't move around freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you stay there, the Vampire will continue to suck your blood and you will eventually die!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve the traps and riddles that obstruct your escape and try to get to the exit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you escape from a guarded prison?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Escape from the Vampire's prison and escape from the Vampire's prison!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vampires will appear and attack you while you are exploring the prison!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you encounter a Vampire, run away and hide yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vampires patrol the prison, so it is important to understand their behavior patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Advance without being noticed.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use items to avoid danger!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You may get items and hints during your search.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let's search and get items to avoid danger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3583660?t=1742026200","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3583660?t=1742026200","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583660/aed90b03b97e2efa11ea64997a7fdfa4015a9dab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742026200","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583660/aed90b03b97e2efa11ea64997a7fdfa4015a9dab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742026200","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"This game may contain c